                            <comment id="16463810" author="dpavlov" created="Fri, 4 May 2018 12:29:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master (ignite 2.6), commit&#160;02e9ca993178d4aa648d06cb93ce1a9277eb22b1&lt;/p&gt;

